## Engine Architecture - 30-second map

```
Query -> EntityRegistry (YAML CRUD, word-boundary match) -> TriageRouter -> ModelGateway
                                                                            |
                                                          Fallback chain (local-first):
                                                          native-gguf(0) -> lmster(1) -> ollama(2)
                                                                            |
                                                              Cloud teachers: google(3) -> opencode-zen(4)
                                                                              -> cline(5) -> copilot(6)
                                                                                            -> mock(7)
```

- `src/omega/oracle/` - main entry: talk/summon/router, model_gateway, entity_registry
- `src/omega/oracle/wad_loader.py` - **CRITICAL PATH** (WAD system)
- `src/omega/oracle/cpu_optimizer.py` - Zen 2 hardware optimization
- `src/omega/oracle/health_monitor.py` - circuit breaker + latency (consolidated, single AsyncCircuitBreaker)
- `src/omega/oracle/gnosis_proxy.py` - soul evolution
- `src/omega/memory_store.py` - Hot/Warm/Cold tiers
- `src/omega/observability.py` - JSONL events + training data + ForensicsManager + JsonFormatter
- `src/omega/request_queue.py` - offline request queue (atomic, heartbeat, dead-letter)
- `src/omega/library/catalog.py` - SQLite document catalog with 5D quality scoring
- `src/omega/benchmarks/runner.py` - LLM benchmark runner with 3-point scale
- `src/omega/hardware.py` - CPU/RAM detection, Zen 2 optimization
- `src/omega/library/` - FTS5 + vector library (7 modules)
- `mcp_servers/omega_hub/server.py` - agent bus (40 MCP tools + 11 HTTP routes)

### WAD stacks (the content layer)

- `config/wads/_omega_default/` - **Reference IWAD** (ships with engine; 10 tech pillars)
- `config/wads/arcana_novai/` - **Personal IWAD** (esoteric pillar entities)
- `config/wads/doom_universe/` - Community IWAD (scaffold)
